# 06: everything at 1/Lambda^8 from dimension eight alone, including two insertions in one amplitude
# interfering with the SM (NP<=4 NP^2<=4).  Needs expansion_order = 4 for NP in coupling_orders.py
# (the shipped dim8_is has it).  Compare with 04: the difference is the double-insertion piece.
# NOTE: this script used to set c8W2H2D2x1, which is class 7 and has NO diagram in
# p p > w+ w- (its lowest vertex is four-point and bosonic, so one insertion cannot
# enter a two-to-two diboson process).  It contributed exactly nothing.  Replaced with
# an operator that does contribute; see examples/studies/diboson/table.md.
import model dim8_is
generate p p > w+ w- NP<=4 NP^2<=4
output runs/06_ww_double
launch runs/06_ww_double
set nevents 5000
set hel_recycling False
set ebeam1 6800
set ebeam2 6800
set lam__2 1000
set c8q2WH2Dx1 1.0
set c8q2W2Dx1 1.0
done
